<programme start="20261121203000 +0000" stop="20261121233000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">NC State at Florida State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Florida State Seminoles (5-5, 3-4 ACC) host the NC State Wolfpack (4-6, 2-5) in Tallahassee. NC State seeks to snap a two-game skid after falling 34-31 to Syracuse, while Florida State seeks to win three straight after beating Pittsburgh 16-10.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
