<programme start="20261122003000 +0000" stop="20261122033000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Stanford at California</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Stanford Cardinal (5-5, 3-4 ACC) visit the California Golden Bears (3-7, 2-5) in Berkeley. Stanford beat Virginia Tech 40-22 behind Micah Ford&apos;s three touchdowns, while California seeks to snap a four-game skid after falling 36-7 to Virginia.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
