<programme start="20261122200000 +0000" stop="20261122220000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">Women&apos;s College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Coastal Carolina at NC State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The NC State Wolfpack clash with the Coastal Carolina Chanticleers in an NCAA play. NC State looks to extend a three-game win streak after beating Georgetown 74-43, while Coastal Carolina aims to rebound from a 90-65 defeat at Indiana on Wednesday.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191292_b_v12_bh.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122220000 +0000" stop="20261123000000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Northeastern at Virginia</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Northeastern Huskies (0-1) take on the Virginia Cavaliers (1-0) at John Paul Jones Arena. The Huskies look to rebound after dropping their season opener 93-85 to the Terriers, while the Cavaliers defeated the Dragons 89-60 behind Thijs De Ridder.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123000000 +0000" stop="20261123030000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Clemson at Duke</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Clemson Tigers visit the Duke Blue Devils for an NCAA Division I FBS conference matchup. Clemson lost 20-6 to Georgia Tech on November 14 with Tait Reynolds, while Duke lost 36-25 to Miami on November 14 with Walker Eget in ACC.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
