<programme start="20261121170000 +0000" stop="20261121203000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">East Carolina at Army</sub-title><desc lang="en">The East Carolina Pirates visit the Army Black Knights for an NCAA Division I FBS American Conference game. East Carolina rides a three-game win streak with Emory Williams, while the Army Black Knights enter on a two-game skid with Cale Hellums.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261121203000 +0000" stop="20261122000000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Old Dominion at UConn</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Old Dominion Monarchs visit the UConn Huskies for an NCAA Division I FBS division game. Old Dominion defeated Coastal Carolina 21-8 on Nov. 7 with Quinn Henicle, while UConn defeated James Madison 46-22 on Nov. 14 with Kalieb Osborne.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261122000000 +0000" stop="20261122033000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">UNLV at San Jose State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The UNLV Rebels visit the San Jose State Spartans for an NCAA Division I FBS conference game. UNLV defeated New Mexico 21-17 on Nov. 14 with Jackson Arnold, while San Jose State lost 24-3 to Air Force on Nov. 14 with Luke Weaver in MWC.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
