<programme start="20261121170000 +0000" stop="20261121200000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Wake Forest at Georgia Tech</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Georgia Tech Yellow Jackets (3-7, 2-5 ACC) host the No. 11 Wake Forest Demon Deacons (9-1, 6-1) in Atlanta. With only one loss this season, Wake Forest enters after beating SMU 49-7, while Georgia Tech beat Clemson 20-6 behind Alberto Mendoza.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
