<programme start="20261121203000 +0000" stop="20261121233000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Arkansas at Texas</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 5 Texas Longhorns (8-2, 5-2 SEC) host the Arkansas Razorbacks (4-6, 2-5) in Austin. Arkansas enters after a 34-6 victory over South Carolina, while Texas seeks a fifth straight victory behind Arch Manning, who leads with 19 touchdowns.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
