<programme start="20261122000000 +0000" stop="20261122030000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Virginia Tech at Miami</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 7 Miami Hurricanes (9-1) host the Virginia Tech Hokies (6-4) for an NCAA football game at Hard Rock Stadium. Virginia Tech aims to break a two-game skid behind Ethan Grunkemeyer, while Miami enters after a 36-25 win against Duke.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
