<programme start="20261122031500 +0000" stop="20261122061500 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Oklahoma State at Arizona State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Arizona State Sun Devils (6-4) host the Oklahoma State Cowboys (6-4) at Mountain America Stadium in a Big 12 matchup. The teams enter this game with identical records. Arizona State aims for a three-game win streak after a 26-13 win against UCF.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
