<programme start="20261122180000 +0000" stop="20261122200000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Women&apos;s College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Ohio State vs. Texas</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 6 Texas Longhorns meet the No. 19 Ohio State Buckeyes at Dickies Arena in NCAA play. Texas relies on 89 points and 6 steals from an 89-57 win, while 5-1 Ohio State counts on 60 points and 8 steals from an 60-57 victory to claim a win.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191292_b_v12_bh.jpg"/></programme>
