<programme start="20261122203000 +0000" stop="20261122223000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Virginia Tech vs. Oklahoma State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Virginia Tech Hokies and the Oklahoma State Cowboys face off at the Shriners Children&apos;s Charleston Classic at TD Arena. The Hokies enter this game with a perfect 6-0 record, while the Cowboys have alternate wins and losses in their last four.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
