<programme start="20261123100000 +0000" stop="20261123103000 +0000" channel="Magnolia Network 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Salvage Dawgs</title><sub-title lang="en">Greek Revival Farmhouse</sub-title><desc lang="en">The team preserves a Greek Revival farmhouse in Bentleyville, Pa., salvaging mantles, tiles and a full-sized chicken coop; Mike and Tay build a freight cart couch; Robert gets excited about a corn sheller.</desc><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><category lang="en">Home</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p9501991_b_v12_ao.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123103000 +0000" stop="20261123110000 +0000" channel="Magnolia Network 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Salvage Dawgs</title><sub-title lang="en">Vaughan Furniture Company</sub-title><desc lang="en">The team heads to the Vaughan Furniture Company in Galax, Va.; Mike and Ted struggle to salvage a heavy furniture press, while Robert is slowed down by explosion-proof lights. Mike and Grayson build a chair with pieces from an old suitcase.</desc><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><category lang="en">Home</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p9501991_b_v12_ao.jpg"/></programme>
