<programme start="20261121110000 +0000" stop="20261121133000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Indianapolis Colts at Houston Texans</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Houston Texans host the Indianapolis Colts in NFL regular-season play at Reliant Stadium. Indianapolis won the first matchup this year, 19-17, but Houston has won four of the past five meetings in the series to hold the recent head-to-head edge.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261121133000 +0000" stop="20261121160000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Minnesota Vikings at Green Bay Packers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Green Bay Packers host the Minnesota Vikings in an NFC North rivalry game at Lambeau Field. Minnesota has won four of the last five meetings, including a 39-22 win at U.S. Bank Stadium earlier this season, and Green Bay looks to even the series.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
