<programme start="20261121180000 +0000" stop="20261121203000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Seattle Seahawks at Las Vegas Raiders</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Las Vegas Raiders meet the Seattle Seahawks at Allegiant Stadium. Las Vegas (4-5) tries to halt a slide of five losses in the last six games, while 5-4 Seattle counts on its defense to grab the road win after allowing just three points last week.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261121203000 +0000" stop="20261121230000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Pittsburgh Steelers at Cincinnati Bengals</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Cincinnati Bengals host the Pittsburgh Steelers in an AFC North game at Paycor Stadium. Both sides enter at 6-2 and winners of their last four regular-season games. The Steelers claimed a 30-27 victory in their meeting earlier this season.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
